bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234320/extras/968cd66019dcabc1448bf403469e7e81.avif?t=1781103737\" alt=\"“THERE IS NO “RIGHT” WAY TO SURVIVE GRIEF - ONLY “YOUR” WAY!” “THE FOG IS THICK THIS MORNING, HONEY, IT’S MAKING YOUR HEAD FUZZY. YOU MISSED THE BUS, YOU’RE STRESSED…”\" width=1024 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "DĪȾĦɆꞦɆĐ invites you to a realm forsaken by the clock—a surreal nightmare where you must platform through the jagged shards of a protagonist's trauma. Guided by two bickering birds and hunted by a ticking horror, you must fight your way through a glitching reality…", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Ukrainian, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234320/652c0f8bb088498ecbdc412c5ec4e9ccb0526f63/header.jpg?t=1781103737", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234320/aab980278902276e7a994fefe477eed35a4f86ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781103737", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4234320/aab980278902276e7a994fefe477eed35a4f86ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781103737", "website": "https://dithered-game.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10x64 / Windows 11x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-14400F (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3050 (or equivalent)<b